- **`backend/handlers/multiAgentChat.ts`** — `executeMultiAgentChat` selects a mentioned agent or the orchestrator; `executeSingleAgent` resolves it through the registry and streams one provider invocation. This is the central place for the recursive execution, conversation continuation, attribution, and er
